  "description": "Real-time collaborative editing for .NET and Blazor, written natively in C#: a YATA-based CRDT engine (text, arrays, maps and sets), a synchronization protocol with jittered reconnection, presence and awareness, offline-first persistence, selective undo, input bindings and the in-memory and WebSocket transports - with no JavaScript CRDT library and no interop in the engine. Includes the Blazor components: BcrdtComponentBase, which marshals change notifications onto the renderer and coalesces them onto a frame budget; BcrdtCollaborationScope, which opens and closes a document for its content; BcrdtTextArea, a textarea that edits a collaborative text without losing keystrokes; and BcrdtPresenceView. Works in Blazor WebAssembly, Server, Web App and Hybrid.",
